# Font library: the font files themselves are NOT tracked (Arial / Times New Roman
# are Microsoft fonts — shipping them in a public repo is not allowed). The two text
# files that describe / rebuild the library ARE tracked, so only the binaries are
# ignored: `fontlib/setup.sh` copies them from the local machine.
fontlib/*.ttf
fontlib/*.otf
fontlib/*.ttc
fontlib/*.otc
